          "startingLine": 14
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Tideverse is an interactive world of original fictional AI characters, guided story journeys, and memories you control. The story chapters are written and bundled with the app; optional online conversations bring the characters' distinct voices to life.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 16
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Responsible design",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 23
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Characters are clearly labeled as artificial and fictional. AI responses may be incorrect, and no character should be considered a professional advisor or a real-life companion. Users decide what memories are saved and when cloud AI is enabled.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 24
        }
      },
